{"data":{"body":"[P2] Wait for winner entry before releasing its gate\n\nThe preceding overlap check can succeed using the victim's loser gate while the winner is still awaiting its checkpoint or initial S3 read. Releasing the winner now lets `hold()` observe `release` on its first read, which throws `Fixture gate was not held` and produces a collection failure even with a correct SDK. Wait for the winner's `BLOCKED` evidence before releasing it, and cover delayed winner entry in a harness test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABAVIO7Q","finding_digest":"d9c964172f86b91b674c2c5060103d64d6cd895bb3e197352ec5531f43431471","finding_id":"arf_v1_3hewifzpq24rwz2mfrigaeb5mt","finding_key":"lmi-tests/tests/test_cloud.py::test_early_return_rejects_late_work_and_preserves_peer::release-before-winner-held","identity_key":"lmi-tests/tests/test_cloud.py::test_early_return_rejects_late_work_and_preserves_peer::release-before-winner-held","line":78,"observation_digest":"7207d9eeaafbf1fa4e28b733cd520b34494c4dd06d0892e0778f1fbe52e3cc8b","observation_id":"aro_v1_oid5t3vk7py7utriw4z42uqlgr","path":"lmi-tests/tests/test_cloud.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-19T18:02:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_yyylrd4pfem5ersfsgafesqevd","reviewed_base_sha":"db6f8436bccd790b2b8ff9537a1278d3059c6a56","reviewed_head_sha":"85d527696f1da9b138219b08bf9a8f371f7f072e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":78,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_um3k67qf32jsifvjrnjwtc2oho"},"pull_request":{"number":928},"record_id":"art_v1_xx7smrqhdim3qql2eikxpn4v5s","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-19T18:02:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
